Task: Boolean Masking
Code Context:
```java
public class LightControl {
    public static void main(String[] args) {
        // 1 represents a lit bulb, 0 represents off
        int[] lightBulbs = {1, 1, 1, 1, 1, 1}; // Start with 6

        // Turn off every second bulb (odd indices)
        for (int i = 0; i < lightBulbs.length; i++) {
            if (i % 2 != 0) {
                lightBulbs[i] = 0;
            }
        }

        // One extra bulb burns out (change the first one to 0)
        lightBulbs[0] = 0;

        // Count how many are still 1
        int litCount = 0;
        for (int bulb : lightBulbs) {
            if (bulb == 1) litCount++;
        }
    }
}
```
